Z||000002||PaUL||04-07-99||06:13 PM||||I swapped the orig 2.5 4cycl in my 86 fiero with a 2.8v6 from an 85 carbuerated Celebrity almost 10 years ago.  All fwd 2.8 blocks are pretty much the same but the exhaust, accessory brackets, and most of the mounts are specific to the Fiero.  If you want to build a Frankenstein Fiero using junkyard parts like I did, email me and Ill share my knowledge with you  
